    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72421" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκωφελ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκωφελ-ίη</span></b> , ἡ (cf. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶκον ὀφέλλειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.21
				</span></i>
			), <i>increase of the household or estate, housekeeping,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖος ἔα ἐν πολέμῳ: ἔργον δέ μοι
					οὐ φίλον ἔσκεν οὐδ᾽ οἰκωφελίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.223
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναιξίν, νόος οἰκωφελίας αἷσιν
					ἐπάβολος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					28.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Naumach.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.23.7
			</span></i>.</div>
